  "title": "Defeat the Exiles",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Defeat the Exiles</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daily_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Daily Quests\">Daily</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">A group of Exiles was suddenly found. Go and defeat them.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intimacy\" title=\"Intimacy\"><img alt=\"Intimacy\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Intimacy.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Intimacy.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/45/Item_Intimacy.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240528230213\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 480</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3,000</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Basic Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Basic Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Basic Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Basic_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/60/Item_Basic_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240528230303\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Defeat the Exiles</b> is a <a href